sk/issues/523#issuecomment-799584023"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"KFwR+"}]},{"client_msg_id":"47fe1c76-45ff-479f-b1ce-8cbc226b67e5","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"そうなんです。caskは長い間ユーザーだったのに最近メンテナになってしまって。。\ncask壊れると結構な人に迷惑になるので、慎重になってるんですが、「慎重すぎる、まず壊せ」とか言われてるんですよね。。","ts":"1617024879.042900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"7X0"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ae48098b-05f1-4472-a08f-fbdbe14564d0","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"自分だとメンテナー視点ではめんどいってのと利用者視点ではサポートしてよって両方の立場になるからアレですw","ts":"1617024767.042200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Yq6Bg"}]},{"client_msg_id":"46e384ad-ec64-42bb-a083-bb6fe1287f8d","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"議論続けるの面倒だし、Emacs-24.5+にするのは合理的ではあるので、次の6月に新しいリリースを出して最小Emacsバージョンを変更することにしました。単なる愚痴を書いて申し訳ないです。。","ts":"1617024716.041400","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"iinoyo","count":3,"users":["U9S4G0LJW","UFHQ7TNT0","U01PWE66A56"]},{"name":"subara","count":1,"users":["UFHQ7TNT0"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"AfrCb"}]},{"client_msg_id":"F14F57AD-A1C7-4E84-96CA-8128DDACCF57","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"古いEmacs、普通に脆弱性ありますからね。","ts":"1617024693.041200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Ihjc"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a95b7651-a1fc-46c4-b848-a2c8eb44c271","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"古い OS を切るのと古い Emacs を切るのとでは意味合いが違うような。\nVim は古い Vim サポートしてなさそうw","ts":"1617024484.040100","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"tashikani","count":1,"users":["U9S4G0LJW"]},{"name":"sorena","count":1,"users":["UFHQ7TNT0"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"XUUA"}]},{"client_msg_id":"